WEBVTT

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.400
We are the...

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.860
...Momoyama Predators!

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:11.820
Okay! We'll just keep on scoring today!

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:14.070
Oh!

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:18.580
That was something unbelievable.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:24.040
Heavenly kicked off and the ball got to Aoto-kun.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.500
In an instant, he was in our half.

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:29.630
One.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.710
Two.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.350
Three.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.040
I won't let you pass!{No way! }

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.140
Four.

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:37.890
Five.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:39.430
Six.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.140
And then the seventh!

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:46.780
This is Heavenly's genius striker!

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:30.830
He passed by seven players.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:52.180
N-No way...

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.480
Impossible.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.200
Aoto!

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.540
That kid...

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.390
That play was just like...

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.370
...Diego Maradona!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.460
Maradona!?

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:41.240
That legendary Argentinian striker who passed by five players and scored?

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:42.350
Yes.

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:47.330
That kid doesn't seem like a special forward,

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:53.500
but he uses his small frame like 
Maradona to create something big.

00:03:54.240 --> 00:04:00.450
Even as his opponent's coach, I have to 
admit that his technique is really something.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.480
It happened in an instant.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:08.290
I... I was there, too.

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:09.920
I... I was there, too.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.190
Coach Hanashima?

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.690
What am I doing?

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:31.980
I'm such an idiot. This isn't right.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.980
This isn't my game.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:35.750
It's their match.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.450
Guys!

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:46.590
Attack with no guard!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:48.910
I told you guys already!

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:50.060
Have you forgotten?

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.300
Coach Hanashima!

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:57.950
Yeah! They only scored one on us!

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:00.730
We just pay them back as usual! Let's attack!

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:03.410
Yeah! The game starts now!

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:04.480
Let's go!

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:05.400
Okay!

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.740
We can do this!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.320
We have a lot of time left.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.830
Hey, Takatou!

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:25.520
Listen up. Don't crowd him when he attacks again.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.690
I'll man-mark him.

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:29.470
You support the back.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.430
Back then...

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.980
Aoto did a sudden change of pace.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.800
Even I got fooled.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:41.820
But now I can see how he moves.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:46.130
If I go up against him again, one-on-one,

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:47.630
I can definitely stop him.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:50.860
Oh? You mad that he got past you?

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:52.910
How rare, coming from you.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:56.050
All right. I'll support you from the back.

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:57.890
That's not it.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:00.790
I can't let him look down on me.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.130
That's all.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.280
He's coming! Clear the ball!

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.250
He's coming!

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:37.040
Just you wait. It won't happen again!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.960
Listen up. Don't crowd him.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:44.530
I hear you, but going up against Aoto-kun one-on-one...

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:49.890
You fool! Were you listening to me!?

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:50.760
Don't crowd him!

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:08.150
I'll stop you this time!

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:26.000
Crap!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.050
Shit!

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.090
No way!

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.450
Yes!

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:37.970
Nice goal, Aoto! Keep it up!

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.510
You bastard...

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:50.070
You're quite something.

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:07.780
Don't mind!

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:09.780
Erika-chan, don't feel down!

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.430
Don't worry about making such tiny mistakes!

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:12.800
Let's keep on attacking!

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.070
Shut up!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:16.030
You're too loud!

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:18.260
Stop screaming about irrelevant stuff!

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:20.780
Okay, let's go! Let's go!

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:23.440
I'll stop Aoto-kun!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.820
H-Hey! Are you okay?

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:29.110
Y-Yes... I'm just a bit beat.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.380
Kota-kun.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:45.250
Even if you pay that much attention to him, 
it seems like he doesn't care about you at all.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:48.710
It's the same with you, too.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.590
And Ouzou.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.540
Ouzou-kun is the most calm out of all of us.

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:57.550
That hot-blooded tantrum just now was unexpected.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.970
Of course.

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:04.140
Last year, it took all three of us just to barely contain him.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.900
And this year, too.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:16.860
Kota-kun, you have been training your techniques in order to catch up with him ever since that day.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.270
I'm counting on you.

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:21.950
If you want him to see you as his rival,

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.380
there is one thing you need to do.

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:27.330
I know what it is without you telling me.

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.720
Calm down and attack!

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.510
Tanaka-kun, pass it to Kota-kun!

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.050
He has no interest in defense, huh?

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:48.770
Then let me go buck wild.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.820
Kota-kun! Over here!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.490
Now's my chance!

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.500
Yes! We scored!

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.530
If I was there...

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:22.640
No wait, what am I saying now?

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:27.500
Nice shot! We got a goal back!

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.560
We start now!

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:29.720
That was nice!

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:30.940
You're great, Kota-kun!

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:48.690
Tch.

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:02.470
Water break time!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.270
Hurry up and drink them!

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.400
The break time is very short.

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:14.350
That was a pretty good opening.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:16.920
Their forward is quite something,

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:18.280
but our forward won't lose!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:22.650
But Coach, if we don't think of a way to stop Aoto-kun,

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:25.290
I don't think we can win.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:26.630
You're right.

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:30.000
But honestly, it's too hard to stop him one-on-one.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:33.200
He's much better than last year.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:37.610
Oh? Are you giving up, Ouzou-kun?

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:39.650
No one's giving up.

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:44.510
But the best way to stop him is to have three people work together!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.180
Cut that crap!

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:50.930
I'll go.

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:52.750
Huh? What do you mean?

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.490
I'll mark him.

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:56.190
You'll mark him!?

00:11:56.190 --> 00:12:00.110
Yes. I'll stop him.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.780
We're both forwards.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:04.840
So I can kinda sense how he plays.{We know how we we play. }

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:07.910
I'm the only one that can stop him...

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.710
But that means...

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:12.410
You guys will score in place of me.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.770
All right, Kota.

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:23.980
You man-mark Aoto.

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:25.160
In place of that...

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:26.360
Yep.

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:28.060
I'll move up top.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.680
Ouzou-kun moves to the center.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:30.570
Yes.

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:34.010
Let me observe and see if Aoto has any weaknesses.

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:35.650
Is that okay, Coach?

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:38.110
Sure, sounds good.

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:41.020
You guys have made the right decision.

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:43.900
Don't lose confidence! Just go and do what you want!

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:44.950
Yes!

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:48.560
Go! Go!

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:49.670
Go! Go!

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:50.120
Momoyama!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:50.530
Momoyama!

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:51.370
Momoyama!

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.000
Go! Go! Momoyama! Go! Go! Momoyama!

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:52.490
Go! Go! Momoyama! Go! Go! Momoyama!

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:53.470
Go! Go! Momoyama! Go! Go! Momoyama!

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:53.860
Go! Go! Momoyama! Go! Go! Momoyama!

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:54.320
Go! Go! Momoyama! Go! Go! Momoyama!

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:55.510
Go! Go! Momoyama! Go! Go! Momoyama!

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:56.830
Yeah!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:59.860
Shou! You better score!

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:02.550
Onii-chan! There's more cake waiting tonight!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:04.740
Erika! Go!

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:07.260
Show them the skill of an Osakan!

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:13.850
Reika-chan! You don't have to score! Just don't get hurt!

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:17.330
That Kota-kun said he wants to go on defense!?

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:18.550
Wow.

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:20.270
Erika-san. Uematsu-kun.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:23.090
We should do what we can.

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.320
Like what?

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:27.960
Uematsu-kun and I will defend their passing lanes and give pressure to the opponent.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:31.230
Erika-san, please aim to intercept the ball as usual.

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:35.290
Oh? Then what happens when Takatou-san gets the ball?

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:37.870
If you get the ball, don't pass it to Ouzou-kun immediately.

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.400
Get me involved in the play.

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:43.510
I'll split the defense and Uematsu-kun
 will charge from the back of their defense.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:45.970
I see. I get it.

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:48.440
But what's wrong with you three today?

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:51.340
Seems like you're enjoying the match today.

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:53.600
I wonder about that?

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:58.370
You'll shoot at the goal properly this time, right?

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:06.150
You're guarding me?

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.780
Shut up. Stop distracting me.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.990
Don't forget about me.

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:22.460
Now how will we advance?

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:24.340
Oh!

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:32.900
What are you doing!?

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:33.600
Crap!

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:43.070
Yes! A corner!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:49.410
Okay! Here's our chance!

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:50.990
Move up, everyone!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.240
You too, Reika-chan.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:58.020
Eh? B-But even if I get in front of their goal...

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.600
I'll just get in the way of everyone.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:02.330
That's fine! Go!

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:06.020
Huh? Okay! I get it.

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:08.520
Um... Where should I be?

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:11.970
Oh! There's no one over there.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:31.820
Reika-chan! Watch out!

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:51.730
Yes!

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:52.970
They did it!

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:55.510
Yes!

00:15:56.710 --> 00:15:59.810
Oh my, what am I doing?

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.940
We're tied! All tied up!

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:11.240
Okay! Time to win this!

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:14.490
Oh? You can score if you try.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:16.170
I wonder about that.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:20.930
I may have been aiming for an own goal and shot it wide.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.800
That's impossible.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.150
What a pain.

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:58.280
This fool!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:22.600
What was that movement just now?

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:26.480
Is he losing his concentration?

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.540
Okay!

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.500
Hey!

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:33.300
We went with the No Guard offense all the way until the end of the first half.

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:36.630
There are spaces everywhere! I'm the Speed Star!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.060
Good job, Shou! Your second goal!

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:06.160
Mom, that was Onii-chan's mistake.

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:19.740
Sorry! I'm really sorry!

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:21.310
Don't worry about that, Shou-kun.

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:24.990
That's the luck of a defender. It happens.

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:26.990
We just have to score more.

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:28.270
Thank you.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.430
What do you think, Kota-kun?

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:34.230
You were with him this entire time. Do you know how to stop him?

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.810
I don't want to admit this, but he's really good.

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:39.440
It's like he controls the space around his legs.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.170
I can't take the ball easily.

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:45.950
But thanks to Kota man-marking him, I figured something out.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:48.660
Aoto sometimes has lapses in concentration.

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:51.710
He starts spacing out and does strange shuffles with the ball.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.420
Those are not feints.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:56.660
Oh, is that so?

00:19:56.660 --> 00:20:01.260
I see. We now know when to commit the tackle.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.170
Maybe.

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:07.140
But it's tough defending when Aoto-kun has the ball.

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:12.970
And we're only down by one goal right now. It'll be bad if we are down by two.

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:17.130
You're right. We're trying to catch up, but now we're falling behind.

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:19.110
What should we do?

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.450
Can you stop him, Kota-kun?

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:25.820
I don't really know if I can stop him.

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:28.790
But... I don't know how to say this properly...

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:32.500
We have to win this game, no matter what.

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:35.000
With this team!

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.640
Kota-kun!

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:40.710
Me, too.

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:43.090
Hard for me to say this, but me too.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.770
Yes! Me too!

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:45.700
Me too!

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:46.820
Same!{Me too!}

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:48.310
Us too!

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:51.180
In any case, we want to win!

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.610
You...

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:09.750
There's only one answer. Team play.

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:22.920
I see. You guys! You want to win that much?

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.720
Yes!

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:27.930
But we don't know what to do...

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:30.280
I see.

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:32.480
That's right! I want to win, too!

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:35.020
There is a way! And if it's you guys, it's possible!

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:38.980
There is a way? Coach Hanashima!?

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:43.490
That's right. Kota, stick to your man-marking 
and move into a defensive midfielder position.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:48.280
Ouzou! You switch with Ryuuji and move up top!

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:51.820
Uchimura, switch with Tanaka.

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:56.490
Tanaka then moves to defensive midfielder and switches with Erika.

00:21:56.490 --> 00:21:59.260
Eh? I can go up to the front?

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:00.600
Yes!

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:04.660
We've been relying on your interceptions, 
so we placed you as a defensive midfielder.

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:07.060
But if Aoto brings the ball up by himself,

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:11.080
then we can use your speed to its full 
advantage and get the ball back on offense.

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:13.520
I understand! I'll do it!

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:17.360
Uematsu, Uchimura, and Ukishima, focus on the left side.

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:21.220
When you see an opening, follows Shou's orders and attack using Small Tri!

00:22:21.220 --> 00:22:22.350
Yes!

00:22:22.350 --> 00:22:24.280
I told you, it's Reverse Three.

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:26.620
And the Furuyas, go with Big Tri.

00:22:26.620 --> 00:22:30.320
No wait, watch what the Small Tri is doing first, then adjust.

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:34.590
In other words, you want us to use the entire pitch like we do with Big Tri...

00:22:34.590 --> 00:22:37.330
...and be able to change positions, right?

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:40.080
You understand quickly. That's right.

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:43.630
Okay! I'll run as fast as I can! Let's do this!

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:45.700
Okay! Let's do this!

00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:47.930
We'll show you the results of our training!

00:22:47.930 --> 00:22:49.340
I'm all fired up!

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:52.550
Okay, let's surprise them silly!

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:55.850
Let's go with the second round of our No Guard offense!

00:22:55.850 --> 00:22:57.320
Yes!

00:23:00.590 --> 00:23:05.500
We'll win. No matter what happens, we'll win!

00:24:34.990 --> 00:24:37.870
